/*
  Imagina Cloud (IMAGINA.md): Spanish (Spain) texts of the app in Imagina's voice.

  Nextcloud's es.lproj/Localizable.strings talks to the person as «usted» in places, has mistakes and leaves some texts in
  English. imagina/apply-branding.py replaces, in Nextcloud's file as published, the value of each key written here and keeps
  everything else. Rules: «tú» (tuteo), Spanish of Spain, quotation marks «», and every format specifier (%@, %d, %1$d…)
  exactly as Nextcloud has it. A key that Nextcloud's file no longer has stops the script: review it after an update.
  {{app_name}} is the app's name (IMAGINA_APP_NAME).
*/

